+
+## Continuity with the frozen sample
+This is a summons **during an incident in the same audit cycle**, not a new sample. The frozen cohort
+`audit-selection-3e577947f99ad8f4c5bf8349ad20df54.json` (epoch 1795543225, SHA-256
