+filed and the cycle token was not used on any `--correction` command. I did not re-adjudicate those cases
+or acquire any sampled issue for productive work. QED evidence: `records/JUDICIARY-REPORT-2026-11-24-cycle-3e577947-sampled-evidence.md`
+and `state/oversight/random/outcomes/<case>.json` on canonical main.
+
